    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- ATK & DEF 500%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Receives an additional Ki +2 per Ki Sphere obtained\n- Launches an additional Super Attack\n- Attacks are effective against all Types\n- Damage reduction rate 65%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Super Class allies' Ki +2, plus guards all attacks for characters\nwho also belong to the \"Planet Namek Saga\" Category\n*When there is another \"Planet Namek Saga\" Category ally attacking\nin the same turn*\n- Damage reduction rate 10%{passiveImg:up_g} before attacking\n*When attacking*\n- ATK 300%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- {passiveImg:once}ATK 300%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*When receiving an attack*\n- DEF 300%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*After receiving an attack*\n- \"Planet Namek Saga\" Category Super Class allies' ATK 50%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- {passiveImg:once}{passiveImg:forever}High chance of performing a critical hit\n*For every attack received*\n- ATK 50%{passiveImg:up_g} within the turn\n*When receiving a Ki Blast Super Attack*\n- Nullifies it for 1 turn from the character's entry turn\n- Great chance of nullifying it starting from the 2nd turn from the\ncharacter's entry turn\n*After the enemy launches a Ki Blast Super Attack at the character*\n- {passiveImg:once}{passiveImg:forever}Launches an additional attack that has a high chance of\nbecoming a Super Attack",
